# 1. Rare Domain Access

## Cas couverts

* ChatGPT
* Gemini
* Claude
* Yandex
* Domaines suspects
* Domaines malveillants

## SPL générique

```spl
index=*
(domain=* OR query=* OR dns_query=* OR DomainName=*)
| stats count by host user domain
| where count < 3
```

