# 6. Obfuscated Command Detection

## Cas couverts

* mshta obfusqué
* powershell obfusqué
* cmd obfusqué

## SPL

```spl
index=*
| regex command_line=".*(\^|\`|%|\$|\+){3,}.*"
```

