# 11. Download → Execute Chain

Inspiré directement du pattern :

```text
cmd
 ↓
curl
 ↓
mshta
```

## SPL

```spl
index=*
| transaction host maxspan=5m
| search process_name IN
(
cmd.exe,
powershell.exe,
curl.exe,
mshta.exe
)
```

