# 14. Brute Force Success

## Cas couverts

* QRadar
* Azure
* Entra

## SPL

```spl
index=*
(action=failure OR action=success)
| transaction user src_ip maxspan=15m
```

Version plus robuste :

```spl
index=*
| stats
count(eval(action="failure")) as failures
count(eval(action="success")) as success
by user src_ip
| where failures > 5 AND success > 0
```

